    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present No. 16 Kilakee Close, Walkinstown, Dublin 12 to the market. This impressive three-bedroom, two-bathroom terraced home is ideally positioned within a quiet and mature cul-de-sac setting, offering generous accommodation extending to an impressive c. 102 sq.m. With a spacious layout, excellent proportions throughout and the added benefit of rear laneway access, this property is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, families and investors alike.\nThe property enjoys a superb location within easy reach of a host of established amenities in Walkinstown and the surrounding areas. Residents have an excellent selection of local shops, cafés, restaurants and leisure facilities close by, while both Crumlin Village and Terenure are within easy reach. The property is also well serviced by a number of bus routes, providing swift access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding suburbs, while the M50 motorway is only a short drive away.\nInternally, the accommodation is both bright and well proportioned. The ground floor boasts a particularly impressive open-plan style living and dining space, creating an excellent setting for both everyday family living and entertaining. The kitchen is positioned to the rear and is complemented by a separate utility room, while a convenient downstairs WC completes the ground floor accommodation. Upstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms and a family bathroom, providing ample space for growing families.\nTo the rear, the property benefits from rear access via laneway, offering excellent convenience and potential for future use. The property also comes to the market vacant with no onward chain, allowing a new owner to move forward without the delays associated with a lengthy onward purchase.\nNo. 16 Kilakee Close represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a substantial family home in a peaceful cul-de-sac setting, while still being within easy reach of all the amenities and transport links that Walkinstown and Dublin 12 have to offer. Early viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the size, layout and potential of this fantastic home.\nFeatures\n•c. 102 sq.m. of living accommodation\n•BER D\n•Three-bedroom, two-bathroom terraced home\n•Quiet cul-de-sac location\n•Spacious open-plan style ground floor\n•Separate utility room\n•Downstairs WC\n•Rear access via laneway\n•Vacant with no onward chain\n•Excellent location close to a host of amenities\n•Easy access to Dublin City Centre & M50 motorway\n•Ideal for first-time buyers, families & investors\nDirections \nEircode D12 V2T3\n"
      },
      {
